    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051118.0240\n\nATHENS, Nov. 18 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nGreek stocks close slightly higher\n\n\n\n\nSmall gains were the order of the day on Friday at the Athens Stock Exchange (ASE), traders here said.\n\nThe composite index rose 0.65 percent to end at 3,509.20 points. The turnover was modest at 214.5 million euros (252.7 million US dollars).\n\nThe FTSE/ASE 20 index for blue chip and heavy traded stocks rose 0.59 percent, the FTSE/ASE MID 40 index and the FTSE/ASE SmallCap 80 index jumped slightly 0.27 percent and 0.21 percent higher respectively.\n\nBroadly, advancers led decliners by 135 to 131 with another 59 issues unchanged.",
